										<img class="sigProImg" src="/plugins/content/jw_sigpro/jw_sigpro/includes/images/transparent.gif" alt="Click to enlarge image GX53_vannaja.JPG" title="Click to enlarge image GX53_vannaja.JPG" style="width:200px;height:160px;background-image:url(/cache/jw_sigpro/jwsigpro_cache_e50bdaa725_gx53_vannaja.jpg);" />
														</a>
