		</span>
	</li>
		<li class="sigProThumb">
		<span class="sigProLinkOuterWrapper">
			<span class="sigProLinkWrapper">
				<a href="/images/svetilniki_gx53/assortiment-v-metalle.jpg" class="sigProLink swipebox" style="width:200px;height:160px;" rel="swipebox[gallerye50bdaa725]" title="" target="_blank">
										<img class="sigProImg" src="/plugins/content/jw_sigpro/jw_sigpro/includes/images/transparent.gif" alt="Click to enlarge image assortiment-v-metalle.jpg" title="Click to enlarge image assortiment-v-metalle.jpg" style="width:200px;height:160px;background-image:url(/cache/jw_sigpro/jwsigpro_cache_e50bdaa725_assortiment-v-metalle.jpg);" />
														</a>
			</span>
		</span>
	</li>
		<li class="sigProThumb">
		<span class="sigProLinkOuterWrapper">
			<span class="sigProLinkWrapper">
				<a href="/images/svetilniki_gx53/potolok-volnoi_v_basseine.JPG" class="sigProLink swipebox" style="width:200px;height:160px;" rel="swipebox[gallerye50bdaa725]" title="" target="_blank">
